# Next.js & React Patterns

## App Router
- Every route folder needs `page.tsx`; layouts in `layout.tsx`
- Dynamic demos route: `app/demos/[slug]/page.tsx` with `generateStaticParams`
- Add `generateMetadata` for SEO on `/resume` and each `/demos/[slug]`

```typescript
// app/demos/[slug]/page.tsx
export async function generateStaticParams() {
  return sites.map((site) => ({ slug: site.slug }));
}
```

## Components
- Functional + typed with an explicit `Props` interface
- Default server component; add `'use client'` only when needed (state, effects, handlers)
- Colocate subcomponents; promote to `components/` only when reused

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
interface DemoCardProps {
  site: DemoSite;
}
export function DemoCard({ site }: DemoCardProps) {
  return (
    <Link href={`/demos/${site.slug}`} className="block rounded-lg border p-4 hover:shadow-md">
      <h3 className="text-lg font-semibold">{site.title}</h3>
      <p className="text-sm text-gray-600">{site.description}</p>
    </Link>
  );
}
```

## Styling
- Tailwind utility classes; extract repeated combos into components, not `@apply`
- Use `next/image` for all screenshots (configure `remotePatterns` if hosted externally)
- Responsive-first: mobile base classes, then `sm:`/`md:`/`lg:` overrides

## Accessibility
- Semantic HTML (`nav`, `main`, `section`, `article`)
- Every interactive element reachable by keyboard with a visible focus ring
- Alt text for images; labels for form controls
